# Brewfile for non-Nix machines (e.g., university Linux via Linuxbrew)
# Minimal: only packages needed to run configs at default level (non-macOS)
# Prefer Nix (`just pack deploy default`) when available.
# System-provided packages (git, bash, curl, wget, less, openssh) are not listed.

